<title>USA: Brooklyn Center, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</title>
<headline>Brooklyn Center, Minn., won by Norwest Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Investment Services said it won $1.440 million of Brooklyn Center, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 4.9829 percent.</p>
</text>
